thOptInterface.jl/pull/2418.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/pull/2418.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Using the `Optimizer` from #2417 
```julia
using JuMP
function main(N)
    model = direct_model(Optimizer(MOI.FileFormats.MPS.Model()))
    @variable(model, 0 <= x[i in 1:N] <= 1; integer = isodd(i))
    @constraint(model, [i in 2:N], x[i] + x[i-1] <= 1)
    @objective(model, Max, sum(i * x[i] for i in 1:N))
    MOI.write_to_file(backend(model).inner, "file.mps")
    return
end
```

Before:

```julia
julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  2.005077 seconds (18.45 M allocations: 812.105 MiB, 9.98% gc time, 24.17% compilation time: 44% of which was recompilation)

julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  1.495755 seconds (17.55 M allocations: 751.348 MiB, 12.09% gc time)

julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  1.529073 seconds (17.55 M allocations: 751.348 MiB, 12.28% gc time)
```

After:

```julia
julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  1.873707 seconds (11.57 M allocations: 602.868 MiB, 8.18% gc time, 29.04% compilation time: 45% of which was recompilation)

julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  1.341565 seconds (10.55 M allocations: 533.148 MiB, 10.52% gc time)

julia> GC.gc(); @time main(100_000);
  1.336950 seconds (10.55 M allocations: 533.148 MiB, 10.17% gc time)
```

Small improvement in time, but big improvement in the number of allocations.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/issues/2418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/issues/2418/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},"comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/issues/comments/1928586707","html_url":"https://github.com/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/pull/2418#issuecomment-1928586707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/issues/2418","id":1928586707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBbYnHc5y8-XT","user":{"login":"mlubin","id":1733683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1733683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin","html_url":"https://github.com/mlubin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlubin/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-06T01:01:10Z","updated_at":"2024-02-06T01:01:10Z","author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Nice improvements!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jump-dev/MathOptInterface.jl/issues/comments/1928586707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_g