I am trying to code a C++ program for the following workflow:

1. Parsing an NLP;
2. Solving it through Ipopt; And
3. Attaining the results.

```julia
using JuMP
using Ipopt

### 1) Parsing an NLP
# creating model
model = Model(Ipopt.Optimizer)
set_silent(model)

# vars
@variable(model, x, lower_bound=0, upper_bound=1)
